fore always free from repetition, injected humour, or non-characteristic words etc.</p>\r\n','','2023-01-28 15:25:45','2024-03-23 12:10:39','2205280001',0,NULL),('SW0012403120001','SW001','ibadah tanggal 10 maret 2024','ibadah-tanggal-10-maret-2024','<p>test</p>\r\n','','2024-03-12 11:36:18','2024-03-12 11:36:18','2205280001',0,NULL);

